    "后端拒绝了实时连接。请确认后端版本与应用一致，并检查反向代理是否支持 WebSocket。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The backend refused the live connection. Make sure the backend version matches the app and check that the reverse proxy supports WebSocket."
          }
